\ Bowl permutations to test, in canonical dictionary order.
\ D=1 gives the first, D=720 gives the last, D=721 wraps.
\ The last Foundation visible drop must select [4,5,2,3,6,1].

\ The test drop is declared explicitly to avoid CAL's compound type parsing.
The bowltestdrop is a wide quantity.

To check the first bowl arrangement:
  Put "1" into the bowltestdrop.
  Choose a bowl order from the bowltestdrop.
  If the chosen bowl order's first identity is not 1,
    put "The bowl order check failed for the first bowl arrangement, position 1." into the check report; exit.
